WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.410
With your own eyes.

00:02.110 --> 00:08.206
This is the Orion Nebula roughly as your eye would see it at a telescope: a faint grey glow.

00:08.656 --> 00:13.411
The gas is real, but it is faint, and in the dark the eye sees no colour.

00:13.861 --> 00:16.907
It cannot save up light the way a camera can.
